Open Kalim

Learn Quranic Arabic. Understand Hadith. Explore the language of Islam.

Open Kalim is an open-source learning app concept inspired by Kalam. It aims to make Quranic Arabic and Hadith learning accessible through a clean, modern, and distraction-free experience.

Features

- Quranic Arabic Learning — Learn Arabic vocabulary and understand words used in the Quran.
- Hadith Learning — Explore Hadith and improve your understanding of Islamic teachings.
- Vocabulary Building — Build your Arabic vocabulary through structured learning.
- Modern Interface — A minimal, clean, and user-friendly design.
- Accessible Learning — Learn without being restricted by expensive subscriptions.

Our Goal

The goal of Open Kalim is to make learning Quranic Arabic and Hadith more accessible, simple, and enjoyable for everyone.

We believe that understanding the language of the Quran should be accessible to anyone who wants to learn.

Project Status

Open Kalim is currently under development.

Features and functionality may change as the project progresses.

Open Source

Open Kalim is a community-oriented project built with the goal of making Islamic learning more accessible.

Contributions, suggestions, and feedback are welcome.

Disclaimer

Open Kalim is an independent project inspired by the concept of Arabic learning applications. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original Kalam application.

Islamic texts and translations should be verified against reliable sources.

